OL,3,GNEWSA'Apocalyptic' fly-tip to stay
OL,4,Auntil fix found
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe city council said it was discussing
OL,7,Fpreventative measures with
OL,8,FWorcestershire County Council ahead of
OL,9,Fa planned "deep clean" of the site
OL,10,Fearly next year.
